## Managed by Ansible
# Queue the requested map update every 12 hours and enforce idle-only rendering.
0 */12 * * * root /usr/local/sbin/minecraft-bluemap-update --schedule >> /var/log/minecraft-bluemap-update.log 2>&1
* * * * * root /usr/local/sbin/minecraft-bluemap-update --watch >> /var/log/minecraft-bluemap-update.log 2>&1
